  "question": "Is the gap between familiar and unfamiliar structures an abstraction problem or a tuning problem?",
  "method": "Arms differ only in whether the primitive action catalog is augmented with temporally extended skills. Same seed, same budget, same evaluation episodes. Every row is a single training seed: PLAN 4.5 requires three, so nothing here meets that bar.",
