    "Skill arms are matched on agent decisions, not primitive environment steps. A skill decision consumes several primitive steps, so the skill arm sees more game time for the same number of learner samples.",
    "supply_furnace is not a usable benchmark against this action set: its random baseline on the structural split is 0.88."
